            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "> (it is listed in ensure_installed), which means that is is automatically attached\r\n\r\nThanks for the kind words and quick clarification.\r\n\r\nUgh. I really dont like the behavior of `installed == loading`.\r\nFeel free to close then or leave it open to nudge upstream into fixing this.",
